  "css": "html[data-theme-id]{--f:Constantia,\"Iowan Old Style\",\"Palatino Linotype\",Palatino,Georgia,serif;--q:rgba(255,255,255,.1);--w:url(\"data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='260' height='97'><style>div{font:13.5px/20.5px Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Palatino,Georgia,serif;color:%23d9ceb8;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance;columns:260px;gap:0}p{margin:9px 0}b{display:block;break-before:column}%3C/style><animate id='z' attributeName='opacity' values='1;0;0;1' keyTimes='0;.3947;.6053;1' dur='3.8' begin='-1.9;z.end+116.2'/><set id='h' attributeName='y' to='0' dur='40' begin='0;h.end'/><svg width='1e5'><set id='c' attributeName='x' to='-1040' begin='480;c.end+1920' dur='480'/><set id='d' attributeName='x' to='-2080' begin='960;d.end+1920' dur='480'/><set id='e' attributeName='x' to='-3120' begin='1440;e.end+1920' dur='480'/><set id='f' attributeName='x' to='-4160' begin='1920;f.end+1920' dur='480'/><svg width='1e5'><set id='b' attributeName='x' to='-520' begin='240;b.end+240' dur='240'/><foreignObject y='-2' width='5200' height='97'><set id='a' attributeName='x' to='-260' begin='120;a.end+120' dur='120'/><div xmlns='http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml'>Let the noise settle like silt in still water.<p/>What remains is the one thing in front of you, and it was always enough.<b/>The river does not hurry, and still it arrives.<p/>Let the work move at the speed of attention.<b/>Nothing is lost by going slowly.<p/>What you tend with a quiet mind takes its own shape.<b/>The mountain does not lean toward the wind.<p/>Sit with the task the way stone sits with weather.<b/>A single lamp is enough to cross a dark room.<p/>Light only the next step, and take it.<b/>Moss grows without announcing itself.<p/>Small, steady work covers the whole stone in time.<b/>The tide does not argue with the shore.<p/>It comes back, and comes back, and the shape changes.<b/>Snow falls one flake at a time and still covers the road.<p/>Trust the quiet weight of small things.<b/>The heron stands until the water forgets it is there.<p/>Stillness is also a way of working.<b/>Smoke rises straight when the air is calm.<p/>Let the mind go quiet and the line draws itself.<b/>A well is dug downward, not outward.<p/>Stay with one thing long enough to reach water.<b/>The moon does not hurry across the pond.<p/>It is whole in every ripple it touches.<b/>Leaves let go without being told.<p/>Put down what is finished and the branch stays light.<b/>Rain does not choose where it lands.<p/>Give the same care to whatever is in front of you.<b/>The wheel turns, and its centre does not move.<p/>Work from the still place.<b/>Dawn arrives without effort.<p/>What is ready will come to light in its own time.<b/>A path appears where feet keep returning.<p/>Come back to the work, and the way wears in.<b/>The bell is silent until it is struck, and silent again after.<p/>Rest between the notes.<b/>Deep water keeps its own counsel.<p/>Go under the surface and stay a while.<b/>The seed does not study the tree.<p/>Begin where you are, and let the rest unfold.</div></foreignObject></svg></svg></svg>\");--j:url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,);--y:var(--j),linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.035),#0000 40%);--B:f 120s steps(1200) infinite alternate;--C:rgba(238,232,220,.1);--D:clamp(28px,3.4vw,46px);--G:inset 0 1px 0 var(--q)}html.dark[data-theme-id]{--guest:#b5895f;--guest-foreground:#dcb98f;--color-violet-300:#e2d7c1;--color-indigo-300:#d6a06c;--color-fuchsia-300:#e2d7c1;--app-scrollbar-thumb:#ffffff24;--app-scrollbar-thumb-hover:#ffffff47}diffs-container{--code-background:#090908}::selection{background:rgba(196,132,78,.42)}:is(.chat-markdown,.composer-tiptap) ::selection{color:#f6eedd}::highlight(t3-assistant-citation-comment){background-color:rgba(196,132,78,.42)}::highlight(t3-assistant-citation){background-color:color-mix(in oklab,#c4844e calc(var(--assistant-citation-highlight-opacity)*100%),#0000)}[data-slot=sidebar-wrapper]{position:relative;isolation:isolate